{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgR4XHJPvaibNzEkrWgkd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Top three complaints, from 9 rows in `reviews.csv`. I counted row 9 once because it duplicates row 2 apart from a double space, so that's 8 unique reviews.\n\n1. **Price (6 of 8).** The complaints are the price doubling, per-seat pricing and the subscription itself.\n   > \"Per-seat pricing killed it for our team of three.\" (Reddit)\n2. **Bugs and reliability (3 of 8).** This covers crashes, double-booking and wrong time zones.\n   > \"Booked twice for the same slot and the client was furious.\" (App Store, 2026-08-02)\n3. **Missing features (2 of 8).** They want SMS reminders and buffer times between meetings.\n   > \"No way to set buffer times between meetings.\" (G2)\n\n- **Sample size:** 8 unique reviews is too small to present as market data. I'd say \"early signal from a small sample\" on the call.\n- **Overlap:** Review 7 counts under both price and bugs (\"Expensive and buggy and the time zones are always wrong\"), so the counts add up to more than 8.\n- **Missing URLs:** Reviews 7 and 8 have no URL, so I can't verify them.\n- **Support:** \"Support never replied to my ticket\" appeared only once (row 2, repeated in the row 9 duplicate), so it didn't make the top three."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":573,"cache_read_input_tokens":42643,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":573},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29d2b65c-654e-59e7-af4d-5e52c30e6871","uuid":"72b5ba2a-07c8-4311-a7d6-822ad4e2b2aa","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:10:25.617Z","request_id":"req_011CgR4XH1nzMErRFuqXoEbS"}
